		{"id":"f1b837462bebd381","x":520,"y":-1860,"width":480,"height":180,"type":"text","text":"FDI invest to VN in 1 year, expect 10% return.\n- Exchange USD to VND\n- After 1 year, Exchange VND to USD"},
		{"id":"6de628b5cd7de453","x":520,"y":-1560,"width":480,"height":240,"type":"text","text":"Hedging Fw rate\n- Benefit: No risk [[Exchange rate]]\n- Cost: Fw rate\n\nActual: Saving rate - TT1, Hedging FW rate - TT2 (interbank)\nwhen TT2 rate < TT1 rate => arbitrage happen"},
		{"id":"06cc8cae45c4434e","type":"text","text":"Cover Interest Rate Parity (CIRP)\n- [[Spot rate]] is NO arbitrage with [[Forward rate]].\n- Forward discount / premium exactly offset [[Interest rate]] differennces.","x":-561,"y":-1980,"width":580,"height":180},
		{"id":"c138f1c4eb11c498","type":"text","text":"International Fisher Affect\n- Real interest assumed to converge across markets\n- If (Free capital flow) --> (Fund move to higher (nominal) rates) --> (Difference with expectation Real Inflation)","x":1240,"y":-3110,"width":560,"height":180},
		{"id":"defe23950f1fd7d7","x":520,"y":-3880,"width":480,"height":400,"type":"file","file":"01_Knowglede/005_Economic/Marco economic/Interest rate/Interest rate.md"},
		{"id":"40891d74038946f1","x":1204,"y":-3692,"width":536,"height":212,"type":"text","text":"Interest rate is BIGGEST driver to [[Exchange rate]]\n- And Exchange rate is price in very soon \n\t(due to expectation early in Central bank)\n- Intermarket Analysis  by Murphy"}
